WEBVTT

02:15.406 --> 02:16.490
Anything?

02:16.574 --> 02:17.992
No one goes in or out.

02:18.075 --> 02:19.326
Figures.

02:19.410 --> 02:22.371
Faraday was right. He changed sites.

02:22.454 --> 02:26.000
It was a lost cause.
Dropped the ball on this one.

02:26.083 --> 02:29.503
Must be big if Arasaka's willing to
clean house over a stolen car.

02:29.587 --> 02:33.090
If only that Faraday'd tell us
what the fuck we after.

02:33.174 --> 02:35.759
This stinks of high-risk shit.

02:35.843 --> 02:38.554
"The biggest fish is always
the one that got away"?

02:38.637 --> 02:41.015
Want me to dig deeper into Tanaka?

02:41.599 --> 02:47.646
Nah, sniffing around
‘Saka business is a fixer's job.

02:47.730 --> 02:51.775
"You are being paid to check off
the boxes on my checklist."

02:51.859 --> 02:55.905
Yeah, yeah.
I went ahead and sicced Kiwi on him.

02:55.988 --> 02:58.741
I guess we'll see what we find.

02:58.824 --> 03:01.035
So we're on hold for now?

03:01.118 --> 03:05.539
We'll need to find a way to kill time…

03:43.118 --> 03:44.662
Said yourself, right?

03:45.579 --> 03:47.206
Alright, fine.

03:48.374 --> 03:50.042
I'm here for Aldo.

03:50.125 --> 03:52.670
Yeah? Who's asking?

03:52.753 --> 03:54.463
Maine sent me.

03:54.546 --> 03:57.299
Hah? You Davis?

03:57.383 --> 03:58.842
Uh…

03:58.926 --> 03:59.802
Huh?

03:59.885 --> 04:01.178
I'm David.

04:01.262 --> 04:02.096
Davis?

04:02.179 --> 04:05.307
David! Not Davis! David!

04:05.391 --> 04:08.352
The fuck you screaming for?!
I can hear you.

04:08.435 --> 04:13.565
David? You're Pilar's carrier pigeon.

04:13.649 --> 04:14.692
Pilar's?

04:15.526 --> 04:21.448
Was you, wasn't it? The punk kid
who klepped and junked the ‘Saka limo?

04:21.532 --> 04:24.243
Yeah… First time on the job.

04:24.326 --> 04:30.708
Could've collected 5K for it at least
if you hadn't gone and trashed it to hell.

04:30.791 --> 04:32.626
-I'll remember that next time.
-Huh?

04:32.710 --> 04:34.128
I'll do better next time!

04:35.754 --> 04:37.715
Next time, eh?

04:37.798 --> 04:41.760
Guess we'll see if last time wasn't
a stroke of beginner's luck.

04:41.844 --> 04:43.220
What do you mean?

04:43.304 --> 04:45.014
Nothing personal.

04:45.097 --> 04:49.351
Won't take long to see if
you're the shit or just a lil' shit stain.

04:50.311 --> 04:52.563
Hear about that cyberpsycho up in Watson?

04:52.646 --> 04:54.315
They just keep popping up.

04:54.398 --> 04:59.862
Yeah, took out two NCPD on patrol.
Saw the scroll. It was damn bloody.

04:59.945 --> 05:04.074
A single launcher hit
turned him into so much canned paste…

05:11.040 --> 05:14.293
Hey David! How've you been?

05:14.376 --> 05:15.461
Uh…

05:15.544 --> 05:17.713
What's up? You need something?

05:17.796 --> 05:21.967
Uh. Got this package here
from Maine for Pilar.

05:22.051 --> 05:22.926
Oh…

05:23.010 --> 05:24.345
Bro!

05:24.428 --> 05:25.888
Bro?

05:25.971 --> 05:28.057
Delivery from Maine!

05:29.183 --> 05:30.309
Fucking finally!

05:30.809 --> 05:35.439
You know how many of
the boys'd kill to get these cyberhands?

05:35.522 --> 05:37.608
Preeem!

05:39.735 --> 05:41.445
Need me to excuse you now, or…?

05:41.528 --> 05:43.864
He have anything else for me to do?

05:43.947 --> 05:45.657
Bro?

05:45.741 --> 05:50.788
Yeah, fuck off. Tip him on his way out.

05:50.871 --> 05:54.041
He's your errand boy!
Fork it over yourself, cheap-ass!

05:54.124 --> 05:55.000
It's bulletproof!

05:55.084 --> 05:57.711
So do I clock out now?

05:57.795 --> 05:59.963
Uh… Looks that way.

06:00.047 --> 06:01.507
Oh. Cool…

06:02.883 --> 06:05.219
Whoa?! All this for a tip?!

06:05.803 --> 06:07.721
You're adorable.

06:08.680 --> 06:10.432
See you later, David.

06:24.196 --> 06:25.823
You came?

06:25.906 --> 06:28.492
You told me to come.

06:28.575 --> 06:30.494
Maine bullied me into it.

06:30.577 --> 06:32.496
Wha… Maine?

06:50.305 --> 06:51.390
Asshole.

06:52.182 --> 06:53.183
You're kidding.

06:53.267 --> 06:55.686
You're telling me. It's my day off.

06:55.769 --> 06:57.938
Sorry to hear it.

06:58.564 --> 07:02.359
No offense, but you're not
exactly built like a punk.

07:02.442 --> 07:07.322
You look like you'd tweak out
after one or two more implants.

07:07.406 --> 07:09.825
I'm not that weak!

07:09.908 --> 07:11.410
Keep up, then.

07:16.165 --> 07:17.958
Ever use one?

07:18.041 --> 07:19.251
No.

07:19.334 --> 07:23.464
Gloria never let you carry?
Well, better start now than never.

07:23.547 --> 07:26.091
Could teach ya if ya want.

07:26.675 --> 07:30.262
Think I'll stick with the Sandevistan.

07:52.993 --> 07:54.036
Hey.

07:54.119 --> 07:54.953
Yes?

07:55.537 --> 07:58.165
So, you're a netrunner?

07:58.248 --> 07:59.500
Yeah. And?

07:59.583 --> 08:02.836
Nothing. Just… do netrunners need to run?

08:02.920 --> 08:07.382
Netrunner, edgerunner. No difference.
Stamina is everything.

08:36.495 --> 08:40.123
Don't leave the house empty-handed
from now on, you hear me?

08:40.999 --> 08:44.920
Every day. You check for your wallet,
your condom, and your gun.

08:45.504 --> 08:49.216
Sure, some punks go straight chrome.

08:49.299 --> 08:54.429
But it's gonna be a while before you can
stay alive with just your cyberware.

08:55.013 --> 08:58.934
Until then, that gun's gonna be
your backup plan.

09:05.691 --> 09:06.775
Hey.

09:06.858 --> 09:07.818
Yes?

09:07.901 --> 09:09.528
How old are you anyway?

09:35.512 --> 09:37.014
How're things with Lucy?

09:37.097 --> 09:38.056
Huh?

09:38.140 --> 09:39.433
You treating her right?

09:40.309 --> 09:46.023
No, I didn't mean… Well, your age
and skills don't really add up.

09:46.106 --> 09:48.358
Skill has nothing to do with age.

09:48.442 --> 09:50.319
It's all about hard work.

09:50.402 --> 09:54.197
Besides, only idiots talk down to
people younger than them.

09:54.281 --> 09:55.657
Like who?

09:55.741 --> 09:57.451
Like long-armed techies.

10:21.767 --> 10:23.852
What do you mean "treating her right"?

10:24.519 --> 10:26.605
Wait… You still haven't done it?

10:26.688 --> 10:28.982
What are we talking about exactly?

10:29.066 --> 10:32.944
David, you're gonna need to
grow a pair of cajones

10:33.028 --> 10:36.448
and I ain't just talking
in a cyberpunk sense.

10:39.534 --> 10:42.245
Thought I saw you two
talking the other day.

10:43.372 --> 10:46.333
At the party after the limo heist.

10:46.416 --> 10:49.836
He likes to act like
my mentor or something.

10:49.920 --> 10:53.840
He got grabby, so I fried him a bit
and told him to scram.

10:53.924 --> 10:55.092
Huh.

10:56.385 --> 10:57.844
How about you?

10:58.428 --> 11:00.681
You serious about edgerunning?

11:08.980 --> 11:10.607
I'm not into her like that.

11:11.191 --> 11:13.360
C'mon kid, we've all got eyes.

11:14.403 --> 11:17.823
She's not into me like that.

11:17.906 --> 11:19.199
Yeah, probably.

11:29.501 --> 11:30.502
Why are you asking?

11:30.585 --> 11:33.422
You just don't seem the type.

11:34.005 --> 11:35.006
Why?!

11:35.590 --> 11:36.425
Tell me!

11:47.602 --> 11:51.273
I just don't know how much of it was real.

11:52.149 --> 11:53.024
What you mean?

11:53.608 --> 11:55.610
Said she wants to go to the moon.

11:55.694 --> 11:56.987
The moon?

11:57.070 --> 11:59.197
Yeah, it's her dream or whatever.

12:27.058 --> 12:28.727
You're faster than you look.

12:28.810 --> 12:30.604
Yeah, yeah.

12:30.687 --> 12:33.732
Really. Doubted you could keep up.

12:33.815 --> 12:37.486
Sarcasm? I'm not that easy to get rid of.

13:15.899 --> 13:18.485
Never said nothing about that to me.

13:19.194 --> 13:20.570
So she lied?

13:20.654 --> 13:22.989
Who knows? Just ask her.

13:23.073 --> 13:27.410
She was probably just stalling me, but…

13:27.494 --> 13:32.207
But we went to the moon together.
With her special BD.

13:32.290 --> 13:34.125
You had a date on the moon?

13:34.209 --> 13:38.380
Shit, you don't get much more
romantic than that in Night City.

13:47.597 --> 13:49.266
Here, a training regimen.

13:50.267 --> 13:54.354
This is just the bare minimum.
You're on your own after today.

13:55.188 --> 13:58.858
If you're serious about this,
you'll need to keep up. And then…

13:59.693 --> 14:00.735
And then?

14:22.048 --> 14:24.175
How long has she been with you guys?

14:25.051 --> 14:28.972
Been about a year? Kiwi brought her in.

14:29.055 --> 14:31.850
Said she found a natural.

14:31.933 --> 14:33.101
What about before that?

14:33.184 --> 14:36.563
I don't know.
Like I said, ask her yourself.

14:37.147 --> 14:39.399
I don't give two shits
about people's pasts

14:39.482 --> 14:42.527
so long as they can pull their weight.

14:42.611 --> 14:44.529
Thought you'd say that.

15:07.969 --> 15:09.471
'Ey, keep it down!

15:11.056 --> 15:12.265
Damn!

15:15.101 --> 15:16.853
Jeez, that's loud.

15:16.937 --> 15:17.771
Gross.

15:17.854 --> 15:18.730
Seriously.

15:18.813 --> 15:21.274
What's your problem, eh?

15:21.358 --> 15:23.109
Why you pissing in the street?!

15:23.693 --> 15:25.862
'Ey, homie! You hear me?!

15:25.946 --> 15:27.238
Leave him alone.

15:27.322 --> 15:28.365
Bye bro.

15:29.157 --> 15:30.700
You aiming for hole-in-one?

15:31.451 --> 15:33.745
I'm talking to ya! Ya hear me?!

15:33.828 --> 15:39.751
Listen, we don't like
walking in piss, asshole.

15:39.834 --> 15:44.673
Alright? This sidewalk belongs to us…

15:44.756 --> 15:49.636
Oh, shit! That's one hell of an implant!

15:50.595 --> 15:53.098
Gives whole new meaning to
the phrase "hard as ir--"

16:11.950 --> 16:13.368
Hey…

16:17.706 --> 16:19.874
Da…

16:19.958 --> 16:23.086
vid…

16:24.462 --> 16:26.256
move…

16:49.571 --> 16:51.406
Not the time to freeze, kid!

16:51.489 --> 16:52.532
Fucking capped him!

16:52.615 --> 16:54.367
-Got bits of Pilar on me…
-Gimme that!

16:54.451 --> 16:57.037
Fucker!

16:57.120 --> 16:58.496
You had no fucking right!

16:58.580 --> 17:01.750
Fucking psycho trash!

17:04.335 --> 17:07.255
Stupid, you'll flatline
faster than you can land a shot!

17:07.338 --> 17:08.757
Let me go!

17:11.134 --> 17:12.177
Die!

17:17.807 --> 17:19.434
Shit, of all times…

17:20.018 --> 17:22.020
Kiwi! Reset Becca's system!

17:22.103 --> 17:23.188
On it.

17:27.192 --> 17:28.234
Where's Lucy?!

17:39.662 --> 17:41.623
Hey, asshole!

17:43.583 --> 17:44.501
David!

18:01.601 --> 18:03.019
Lucy!

18:04.854 --> 18:05.939
I'm alright.

18:06.606 --> 18:08.024
Good.

18:10.193 --> 18:11.027
You're bleeding…

18:18.618 --> 18:23.414
I'm the only one
who was allowed to kill him…

18:27.544 --> 18:28.962
Don't touch me.

18:29.045 --> 18:30.922
Do you need medical?

18:31.005 --> 18:31.965
No.

18:32.048 --> 18:35.593
Dorio, take Lucy to see a ripperdoc.

18:36.219 --> 18:39.931
I'll stay with Kiwi until the pigs arrive.

18:40.014 --> 18:43.351
Someone's gotta explain this mess.

18:43.434 --> 18:44.936
You heard him.

18:46.437 --> 18:49.107
You go with 'em, kid.

18:49.190 --> 18:50.066
Huh?

18:50.150 --> 18:55.029
We'll tell 'em we took him
out after he zeroed Pilar.

18:55.113 --> 18:58.533
They'll file it as a cyberpsycho incident,
but it's better that you ain't here.

18:58.616 --> 18:59.450
But…

18:59.534 --> 19:01.369
I saw what you did.

19:01.452 --> 19:03.997
Time you stopped thinking like a rookie.

19:06.082 --> 19:10.336
You lot again? I'm not actually
a licensed physicist, you know.

19:10.420 --> 19:13.464
I didn't volunteer to come either.

19:13.548 --> 19:15.175
Charming.

19:15.258 --> 19:16.509
I'll go alone.

19:17.385 --> 19:20.096
Clean her up and get her home.

19:20.180 --> 19:23.224
-You're leaving?
-Maine said you could take his car.

19:30.899 --> 19:32.025
Lucy.

19:42.410 --> 19:44.245
-Here's fine.
-Sure.

19:44.329 --> 19:45.246
Good night.

19:45.872 --> 19:50.376
Um… Can we talk?

19:54.839 --> 19:56.049
This way.

20:00.345 --> 20:02.931
Aw. It's all cloudy.

20:03.014 --> 20:07.060
That moon BD you showed me
was pretty sweet.

20:12.690 --> 20:15.318
I had something
I wanted to talk about, too.

20:15.401 --> 20:16.277
Oh?

20:16.361 --> 20:21.449
I know how it must look but…
What I told you that day before?

20:21.532 --> 20:24.661
I wasn't lying.
It was the first time I told anyone.

20:24.744 --> 20:25.787
That's…

20:25.870 --> 20:29.791
That's good.
I didn't want to think you were lying.

20:30.416 --> 20:32.043
What if I'm lying now?

20:32.126 --> 20:34.295
-I don't think you are.
-Why not?

20:34.379 --> 20:37.048
-'Cause I don't like that.
-That's crazy.

20:37.131 --> 20:39.676
You should've said something earlier.

20:39.759 --> 20:41.427
I couldn't.

20:41.511 --> 20:42.428
Why not?

20:43.012 --> 20:44.681
You were so mad at me.

20:44.764 --> 20:46.057
I wasn't mad.

20:46.140 --> 20:48.059
Was too.

20:48.142 --> 20:52.313
I wasn't mad, just…
Well, yeah. Guess I was.

20:52.397 --> 20:53.564
See?

20:53.648 --> 20:55.566
I was angry, but…

20:55.650 --> 20:57.568
I wasn't pissed at you.

20:59.654 --> 21:01.823
Wouldn't have saved you if I did.

21:01.906 --> 21:03.574
-Liar.
-I'm not.

21:03.658 --> 21:04.701
No, that's a lie.

21:04.784 --> 21:11.249
You're the kind of guy who'll jump in fire
to save someone, even if you get burned.

21:11.958 --> 21:13.543
You're that type.

21:14.544 --> 21:16.921
Is that why you think I won't make it?

21:17.505 --> 21:20.300
Maine thinks I will. Why can't…

21:20.383 --> 21:24.846
No, it's not that. You'd make
a good edgerunner, I think.

21:25.638 --> 21:27.598
I really do.

21:27.682 --> 21:29.017
So what's the problem?

21:29.100 --> 21:32.979
You don't make a name
as a cyberpunk by how you live.

21:34.022 --> 21:35.648
You're remembered by how you die.

21:37.734 --> 21:40.069
It's not the life or the end you deserve.

21:40.153 --> 21:43.281
What makes me any different from you?

21:43.364 --> 21:46.034
I have nowhere else to go.

21:46.117 --> 21:47.410
I don't either.

21:47.493 --> 21:49.203
You and I are worlds apart.

21:49.287 --> 21:50.580
How?!

21:54.083 --> 21:56.252
I'll take you to the moon!

21:58.087 --> 21:59.714
I promise!

22:09.599 --> 22:11.517
I just don't want you to die.

22:29.827 --> 22:31.412
I won't.
